Third-party data in this repository
===================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code. It does not cover the data, which is
redistributed here under the terms of whoever produced it.

City of Berkeley
----------------
  build/streets_raw.json.gz    street centreline network
  build/data.json              fire zones, hazard zones, stations, chipper areas,
                               narrow streets, street geometry
  build/council_districts.json council district boundaries

Retrieved from the City's public ArcGIS server at gis.cityofberkeley.info and
redistributed under whatever terms the City publishes it. The City is the
authority on all of it; where this repository disagrees with them, they are right.

